{
 "items": [
  {
   "id": "l01",
   "text": "这是一个矩阵：一、一，零、一。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l02",
   "text": "课本教你，用它乘一个向量，就是行乘列，再相加。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l03",
   "text": "你可能算得很熟。可有没有想过，这四个数，到底“是”什么？",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l04",
   "text": "这支视频只讲一件事：矩阵，其实是在描述整个平面的一次变换。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l05",
   "text": "先说“变换”。它就是一个函数：输入一个向量，输出一个向量。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l06",
   "text": "与其一个一个去看，不如把每个向量都当成一个点，看整张网格怎么动。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l07",
   "text": "比如这一次：横轴上的点不动，上方的点往右滑，下方的往左滑，离横轴越远，滑得越多。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l08",
   "text": "线性代数只关心一类特别规矩的变换，叫线性变换。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l09",
   "text": "规矩只有两条：原点不动；任何直线变完还是直线，网格线依旧平行、间距均匀。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l10",
   "text": "像这样把线弄弯的，不算。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l11",
   "text": "像这样整体挪开，原点跑掉的，也不算。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l12",
   "text": "那问题来了：平面上有无穷多个点，怎么描述一次线性变换？",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l13",
   "text": "答案出奇地省事：只要盯住两个向量。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l14",
   "text": "一个叫 i，向右一格；一个叫 j，向上一格。头上的小帽子表示长度为一，它们叫基向量。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l15",
   "text": "任何向量都能用它们拼出来。比如这个向量，负一、二，就是负一个 i，加上两个 j。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l16",
   "text": "现在做变换。负一个 i 加两个 j，就是沿着网格往左走一格，再往上走两格。网格怎么变，这条路线就跟着怎么变，步数不会变。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l17",
   "text": "变换后的向量，依然是负一个新的 i，加上两个新的 j。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l18",
   "text": "所以，只要知道 i 落到哪、j 落到哪，整个平面去哪儿，就全都确定了。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l19",
   "text": "看刚才那次变换：i 没动，还在一、零；j 被推到了一、一。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    2
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l20",
   "text": "把 i 的落点写成第一列，j 的落点写成第二列。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l21",
   "text": "这就是开头那个矩阵。它的两列，就是两个基向量的新位置。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l22",
   "text": "那矩阵乘向量呢？任意向量 x、y，就是 x 个 i 加 y 个 j；变换以后，就是 x 个新的 i 加 y 个新的 j，也就是 x 倍的第一列，加上 y 倍的第二列。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    2
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l33",
   "text": "合起来就是 x 加 y、y，和开头课本行乘列算出来的，一模一样。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l23",
   "text": "代入负一、二：负一倍的一、零，加上两倍的一、一，得到一、二。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l24",
   "text": "再看画面，这个向量正好落在一、二。算式和运动，说的是同一件事。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l25",
   "text": "来试一个。这个矩阵的第一列是零、一，第二列是负一、零。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l26",
   "text": "先暂停想一想：它会把平面变成什么样？",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l27",
   "text": "第一列说，i 去了零、一，也就是正上方。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l28",
   "text": "第二列说，j 去了负一、零，也就是正左方。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l29",
   "text": "两个基向量都逆时针转了九十度，所以整个平面，就是绕原点逆时针转了九十度。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l30",
   "text": "记住这一句：矩阵的每一列，就是一个基向量的落点。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l31",
   "text": "以后看到矩阵，别急着算，先问它：你把 i 和 j 送到了哪里？",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l32",
   "text": "下一集，我们让两个变换接连发生，看看为什么那就是矩阵乘法。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  }
 ]
}